@startuml
title Squads v4 Multisig-Governed Solana Program Upgrade (Upgradeable BPF Loader)

actor Dev as "Developer / CI"
actor Proposer as "Proposer (Squad member)"
actor Approver as "Approvers (other Squad members)"
actor Executor as "Executor (member/bot)"

participant Squads as "Squads v4 Program"
participant Loader as "BPF Upgradeable Loader"
database Buffer as "Buffer Account (staged .so bytes)"
database ProgramData as "ProgramData Account (active program bytes/metadata)"
participant Program as "Upgradeable Program (Program ID)"

== One-time setup (done once per program) ==
Dev -> Squads: Create Squad (members + threshold)
Squads -> Squads: Create multisig state + authority PDA

Dev -> Loader: Initial deploy (create Program + ProgramData as upgradeable)
Loader -> ProgramData: Initialize ProgramData (sets initial upgrade authority)

Dev -> Loader: Set upgrade authority to Squad PDA
Loader -> ProgramData: SetAuthority(ProgramData.upgrade_authority = Squad PDA)

== Build new version ==
Dev -> Dev: Build new program binary (.so)

== Stage binary on-chain (Buffer creation + chunk writes) ==
Dev -> Loader: Create buffer account sized for .so (rent-exempt)
Loader -> Buffer: Create/allocate buffer data space + metadata\n(authority = Squad PDA or deploy authority)

loop For each chunk of .so
  Dev -> Loader: Write(Buffer, offset, bytes)
  Loader -> Buffer: Store bytes into account data
end

== Propose upgrade via Squads ==
Proposer -> Squads: Create proposal with Upgrade instruction payload\n(program, programdata, buffer, authority=PDA)
Squads -> Squads: Store proposal + target instructions

== Approvals ==
Approver -> Squads: ApproveProposal(proposal_id)
Squads -> Squads: Record approval, check threshold

== Execute (threshold reached) ==
Executor -> Squads: ExecuteProposal(proposal_id)
Squads -> Squads: Verify threshold + proposal state

note over Squads,Loader
Execution uses the Squad authority PDA (invoke_signed)\n(not aggregated member ed25519 signatures).
end note

Squads -> Loader: Upgrade(program, programdata, buffer, authority=PDA) (invoke_signed)
Loader -> Loader: Verify upgradeable + authority + buffer validity
Loader -> ProgramData: Replace/refresh active program bytes from Buffer
Loader -> Program: Program now runs new code

== Post-upgrade (optional) ==
Dev -> Loader: Close(Buffer, recipient) to reclaim lamports
Loader -> Buffer: Deallocate/transfer lamports

@enduml